Package: programimpact
Title: BWBS Program Emissions Impact
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Study", "Club", email = "pcarbomestre@ucsb.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pulls program-level emissions totals for the 2024 BWBS season from
    BigQuery and plots actual, counterfactual and impact figures. Exists as a
    sandbox for demonstrating CLAUDE.md setup.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: bigrquery, ggplot2, patchwork
